# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository; let Git handle the
# checkout-side conversion per-platform. This project builds on both
# Linux (development) and Windows (CI) — worth being deliberate about
# line endings rather than leaving it to each contributor's local Git
# config, which is how mixed-EOL diffs happen.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch/PowerShell scripts, if any get added later, should stay CRLF —
# not currently present, but a reasonable default to have in place ahead
# of that, since native line endings occasionally matter for cmd.exe.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary/generated — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.svg -text
